# Projects are separate private repos; only the template and README belong to the workflow repo
My Projects/*
!My Projects/_Project_Template/
!My Projects/README.md

# Storybook cache when a project Storybook is started from the Root (a project preview in .claude/launch.json)
node_modules/

# Private notes and local-only Claude instructions (kept on the owner's machine)
private/
CLAUDE.local.md
